---
import PwaHead from '../components/PwaHead.astro';
---

<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <PwaHead />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Нет сети · BikeTrue</title>
    <style is:inline>
      :root { color-scheme: light; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        min-height: 100dvh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 20px calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
        color: #1c1917;
        background:
          radial-gradient(900px 420px at 80% -10%, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.28), transparent 60%),
          #fffdf8;
        font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      main { width: min(460px, 100%); }
      h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.04em; font-weight: 600; }
      p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #44403c; }
      button {
        margin-top: 12px;
        min-height: 44px;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #1c1917;
        color: white;
        font: inherit;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Нет сети</h1>
      <p>BikeTrue на месте. Страницы, которые уже открывались, и последний разбор остаются на устройстве.</p>
      <p>You’re offline. Pages you’ve already opened, and the last reading, stay on this device.</p>
      <button type="button" onclick="location.reload()">Обновить · Retry</button>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
